  "text": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\" />\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\" />\n  <title>FocusFlow - Student Study Planner</title>\n  <style>\n    * {\n      box-sizing: border-box;\n    }\n\n    body {\n      margin: 0;\n      padding: 0;\n      font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;\n      background-color: #1a1a1a;\n      color: #ffffff;\n      display: flex;\n      flex-direction: column;\n      align-items: center;\n      height: 100vh;\n    }\n\n    header {\n      background-color: #1a1a1a;\n      padding: 20px;\n      display: flex;\n      justify-content: center;\n      align-items: center;\n      color: #ffffff;\n      font-size: 2em;\n      text-shadow: 0 0 10px #000000;\n    }\n\n    nav {\n      background-color: #1a1a1a;\n      padding: 10px;\n      display: flex;\n      justify-content: center;\n      align-items: center;\n      color: #ffffff;\n      font-size: 1em;\n      text-shadow: 0 0 10px #000000;\n    }\n\n    nav a {\n      color: #ffffff;\n      text-decoration: none;\n      font-size: 1em;\n      text-shadow: 0 0 10px #000000;\n    }\n\n    .hero {\n      background-color: #1a1a1a;\n      padding: 40px;\n      display: flex;\n      flex-direction: column;\n      align-items: center;\n      justify-content: center;\n      color: #ffffff;\n      font-size: 2em;\n      text-shadow: 0 0 10px #000000;\n    }\n\n    .hero h1 {\n      margin-bottom: 20px;\n    }\n\n    .hero p {\n      margin-bottom: 30px;\n    }\n\n    .hero button {\n      background-color: #1a1a1a;\n      padding: 10px 20px;\n      border: none;\n      border-radius: 5px;\n      color: #ffffff;\n      font-size: 1em;\n      text-shadow: 0 0 10px #000000;\n      cursor: pointer;\n      transition: background-color 0.3s;\n    }\n\n    .hero button:hover {\n      background-color: #000000;\n    }\n\n    .feature-card {\n      background-color: #1a1a1a;\n      padding: 20px;\n      border-radius: 10px;\n      margin: 20px;\n      display: flex;\n      flex-direction: column;\n      align-items: center;\n      justify-content: center;\n      color: #ffffff;\n      font-size: 1em;\n      text-shadow: 0 0 10px #000000;\n    }\n\n    .feature-card h2 {\n      margin-bottom: 10px;\n    }\n\n    .feature-card p {\n      margin-bottom: 20px;\n    }\n\n    .feature-card button {\n      background-color: #1a1a1a;\n      padding: 10px 20px;\n      border: none;\n      border-radius: 5px;\n      color: #ffffff;\n      font-size: 1em;\n      text-shadow: 0 0 10px #000000;\n      cursor: pointer;\n      transition: background-color 0.3s;\n    }\n\n    .feature-card button:hover {\n      background-color: #000000;\n    }\n\n    .email-form {\n      background-color: #1a1a1a;\n      padding: 20px;\n      border-radius: 10px;\n      display: flex;\n      flex-direction: column;\n      align-items: center;\n      justify-content: center;\n      color: #ffffff;\n      font-size: 1em;\n      text-shadow: 0 0 10px #000000;\n    }\n\n    .email-form h2 {\n      margin-bottom: 20px;\n    }\n\n    .email-form input {\n      padding: 10px;\n      font-size: 1em;\n      border: none;\n      border-radius: 5px;\n      color: #ffffff;\n      text-shadow: 0 0 10px #000000;\n      cursor: pointer;\n      transition: background-color 0.3s;\n    }\n\n    .email-form input:focus {\n      background-color: #000000;\n    }\n\n    .email-form label {\n      margin-bottom: 10px;\n    }\n\n    .email-form button {\n      background-color: #1a1a1a;\n      padding: 10px 20px;\n      border: none;\n      border-radius: 5px;\n      color: #ffffff;\n      font-size: 1em;\n      text-shadow: 0 0 10px #000000;\n      cursor: pointer;\n      transition: background-color 0.3s;\n    }\n\n    .email-form button:hover {\n      background-color: #000000;\n    }\n\n    footer {\n      background-color: #1a1a1a;\n      padding: 20px;\n      display: flex;\n      justify-content: center;\n      align-items: center;\n      color: #ffffff;\n      font-size: 1em;\n      text-shadow: 0 0 10px #000000;\n    }\n\n    footer a {\n      color: #ffffff;\n      text-decoration: none;\n      font-size: 1em;\n      text-shadow: 0 0 10px #000000;\n    }\n\n    @media (max-width: 768px) {\n      .hero {\n        padding: 20px;\n      }\n\n      .feature-card {\n        padding: 10px;\n      }\n\n      .email-form {\n        padding: 10px;\n      }\n    }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <header>\n    <h1>FocusFlow</h1>\n    <nav>\n      <a href=\"#\">Features</a>\n      <a href=\"#\">Get Started</a>\n    </nav>\n  </header>\n\n  <section class=\"hero\">\n    <h1>FocusFlow - Your Study Planner</h1>\n    <p>Plan your study sessions with ease. FocusFlow helps you organize your study time effectively.</p>\n    <button>Start Planning</button>\n  </section>\n\n  <div class=\"feature-card\">\n    <h2>1. Smart Study Schedules</h2>\n    <p>Get personalized study schedules tailored to your learning style and goals.</p>\n    <button>Get Started</button>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"feature-card\">\n    <h2>2. Time Blocking</h2>\n    <p>Block your study time with specific hours and subjects to maximize productivity.</p>\n    <button>Get Started</button>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"feature-card\">\n    <h2>3. Study Tips</h2>\n    <p>Get expert study tips and strategies to improve your study habits and performance.</p>\n    <button>Get Started</button>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"email-form\">\n    <h2>Sign Up for FocusFlow</h2>\n    <p>Get started with a free trial. Your email will be shown here without sending any data.</p>\n    <input type=\"email\" placeholder=\"Enter your email\">\n    <button>Get Started</button>\n  </div>\n\n  <footer>\n    <p>\u00a9 2023 FocusFlow. All rights reserved.</p>\n  </footer>\n</body>\n</html>",
